Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to beat\Nan expert dueling computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the person controlling\Nit that worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kaiba's got some pretty\Nscary enemies. No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who would hack into an amusement\Npark and trap 50 innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, as soon as Yugi wins this\Nduel, we're all gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is the number one\Nduelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he's gonna lose\Nto some machine. You sure? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That hunk of junk computer's\Ngonna be running home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,to its motherboard after\NYu-Gi's finished with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well put.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.27,0:01:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With Rick's deck of all dragon\Ncards, this isn't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.35,0:02:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll begin with Petite\NDragon in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But that thing's only got 700 points.\NThat's because he's using that kid's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,amateur deck He doesn't even have any\Nmagic or trap cards to choose from
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we have a bit of a situation\Non our hands Someone's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,infiltrated the Kaiba Dome's central\Ncomputer system. No way. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.57,0:02:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone inside is being held captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe flight, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dankeschön, Ludwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, see to it that the swimming pool is\Nfilled with fresh milk upon my return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It does wonders for my complexion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see we'll be taking\Nthe lavender jet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it matched your\Nwardrobe quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Kostdow magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kostdow reduces the level of every\Nmonster in my hand by two stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,no sacrifices are necessary in order to\Nsummon Air Knight Parsath in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now activating Trap Card, Robin Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Goblin remains active,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you must delete one card\Nfrom your hand each time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster inflicts damage\Nto your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Air Knight Parsaf, destroy Petite Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Air Knight's special ability\Nwill now activate. Because this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,creature attacked a monster in\Ndefense mode The difference between
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,monster's defense points and\NAir Knight's attack points Are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,deducted from your life points\NAnd one additional card is drawn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now initiating the special effect of Robin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Goblin Remove one card from your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Deposit in card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Last move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Berserk Gorilla attacks opponent directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off to a bad start, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, call that scrap\Nheap to the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Ability of Robin\NGoblin is once again activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent must delete one card from hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn complete. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for my Dragon\NDeck, you'd be winning now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck is strong. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it has heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing\Nmore powerful than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's still a chance we can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to unlock the\Ntrue power of Rick's deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to draw that card I gave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.93,0:05:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move! Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick did have a magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Luster Dragon in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play this\Ncard, Dragon Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card raises\Nthe attack and defense
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,strength of every dragon\Non the field by 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, luster dragon,\Nattack with breath of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, you cyber geek!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good old-fashioned\Nbrains over microchips any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing new card, next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to special ability, Sinister Serpent\Nis returning from card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now summoning Slave\NWarrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that computerized\Nchump doing playing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a monster that only has\N1,900 attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have short-circuited\Nafter that last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.23,0:06:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But watch what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When slave warrior is wiped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the monster responsible for its destruction\Nloses 500 attack and defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That computer just sacrificed its own\Nlife points just to weaken my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Berserk gorilla attack\Ntarget luster dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.61,0:07:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin Goblin's ability\Nwill once again activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent will discard one card from hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if this keeps up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gonna lose his best cards\Nand then it's all over, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dude, how about a few\Nwords of encouragement?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn has concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my cave-dwelling\Ndragon in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see old\NMotomouth get through that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Processing counter-strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing Berserk Gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All trap cards are now useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me that computer\Nhas Jinzo in its deck? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the Kaiba Corp\Ndual system has access
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,to just about every card\Nthat was ever created,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo will now attack Dragon\Nwith Cyber Energy Shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, destroy your mood. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the Underdog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The card you gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This will bring out the\Ntrue strength of your deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that card do, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll summon Baby\NDragon in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate this magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Heart of the Underdog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this works!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that dog under?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone should know that card, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They should just call\Nit Heart of the Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You go, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning Sinister Serpent in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Jinzo attacks Baby Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinister Serpent will now\Nstrike opponent directly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn complete. The time\Nhas come to end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the special\Nability of Heart of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the Underdog If I draw\Na monster from my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm free to draw another card and if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a monster as well\Nthen the cycle continues
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and now for my first card i've drawn curse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,of dragon so i draw again\Nkumori dragon winged
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon of the fortress\Ni'm not done yet i draw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,crawling dragon followed\Nby blackland fire dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I now play Spirit Rue in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Spirit Rue, attack his\NJinzo with Sonic Flash Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to its special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the attack power of my Spirit\NRue increases by 1,000 points
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,for every dragon I discard from\Nmy hand And I count six dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That means my spirit rule gains\Nan additional 6,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my spirit, destroy his Jinzo\Nand the rest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, we're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you its bark was\Nworse than its gigabyte.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So did I. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, it was your passion\Nfor your cards that saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll trade anything for\Na few of those dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Six Kulevos for one dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel was merely one\Nrose in my garden of mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So enjoy yourselves while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The good guys win again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice how it always works\Nout that way, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the card, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take real good care of it. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya! Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never guess what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,About that underdog card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it reminds you of someone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, a little help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, well, that's\Nreally mature, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,because everyone else over there seems to\Nthink that I remind you of this underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me think of the\Nbest way to put this, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That card makes me think of you because\Neven when the odds are against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you always pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your business cards now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler, executive underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.97,0:12:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Moguba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bit late to save\Nthe day, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi already did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you're finally here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you can fix that wacko\Ncomputer of yours, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down, you underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's nothing\Nwrong with that computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the hacker who broke\Nin that's the wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Mokuva.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a long list of suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As we've seen many times in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the Kaiba Corporation\Nhas its share of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't really surprise me that\Nsomeone's out to sabotage my new tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But mark my words, this punk\Nwill be found and punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, I want security tripled for\Nthe tournament registration tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford any more\Nunexpected interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The only attacks this week should be\Nin the Kaiba Dome. Yes, sir. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyone who's late for\Nregistration will be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, make sure Wheeler's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know an insult when I hear one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me when I'm yelling at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, who are all these people, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to create\Na big buzz about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so we invited every newspaper\Nand TV network we could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell those reporters something\Nand the whole world hears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, world, Tristan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No one cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler, two-time finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's obvious who\Nthey all came to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shout time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrimp, the kiddie park's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a piece of me? Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Taya, her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto? Uh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd recognize that adorable\Nspiky hair anywhere! Uh, thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Vivian Wong, but call me Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hi, Viv!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of him. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know once the competition starts You\Nand I are going to be arch rivals, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:15:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean we can't be\Nbuddies When we're off the playing field
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a quiet one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, break it up Yeah, you might\Nwant to let him come up for air, Viv
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that Seto Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo, Kaiba-boo. What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Leon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the KC Grand Championship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're kidding me. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's been my dream to duel\Nagainst you ever since Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is money. But, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we're still waiting\Nfor one more challenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I make that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon my tardiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffic was a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I rose to the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:16:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Herr Khyber, I'm Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You show some respect if\Nyou want to stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This day will go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,For today begins the most prestigious Duel\NMonsters Tournament ever to be organized!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Kyber\NCourt Grand Championship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's strut our stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We've circled the globe to bring you\Nthis all-star congregation of duelists!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,First up, the new boy wonder of Dooling,\Nthe prodigy who's yet to be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The one, the only, Leapin' Leon Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew that kid was such a big shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:17:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a mystery, wrapped in a\Nriddle, wrapped in a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune Salim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And straight from the Wild West, please\Nwelcome the Lone Dealer, Shane Jordan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, it's the Siberian\NMuscle, Sergei Dimonoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And always clued into his\Nopponent's strategies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the calm and collected super sleuth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.09,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Paul McGregor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, our very own\Nwild child, the Monkey Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He extracts points from his opponents\Nwith surgical precision, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Richard Gault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, it's the master of the magic cards,\Nthe always debonair, Balfree Ginger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Zing isn't always believing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,just as the dual\Nillusionist, Totani Eolos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the thunder from down under, here\Nto duel and plunder, Ethan Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks, therefore he is Jafar Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't be fooled by Vivian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This delicate flower pack's quite a kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.87,0:18:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, the youngest\Nregional champ, Rebecca Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, it's Joey Wheeler, our\Noverwhelming underdog. Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about a little respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And hailing from parts unknown,\NThe Masked Duelist, Afnog Otum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Afnog?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And our final challenger, the\Nalways stylish Zig Green Lloyd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And our defending champion, Yuki Moto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins this 16th Duelist\NElimination Competition will go on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,To face Yugi for the International\NDuel Monsters Championship Crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, this looks like the toughest\Nbunch of competitors we ever faced, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure fair play,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,match pairings will be randomly chosen\Nby our computer just before every duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you won't have a chance to\Nprepare for your opponents ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and it means that none of these guys will\Nhave a chance to prepare for me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, on behalf of\Nthe Kaiba Corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to wish you all the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You represent the top-ranked\Nduelists from across the globe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but only one of you can be proud,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the world champion!
